# Who reviews what. GitHub asks the owners of every changed file for a review.
#
# For each file, the LAST matching line wins. Frozen paths are therefore listed
# last, so they override the team that owns the folder around them (for
# example the two baseline scenarios inside scenarios/).
#
# Every file in the repository must be covered. Check with:
#     python scripts/check_codeowners.py
#
# The team handles are placeholders: create these teams in the
# WisconsinAutonomousDynamics GitHub organisation.

